From jinggong-runtime-fork
Subject: [PATCH] build an independently branded Jinggong App Server

The patch is applied by scripts/build-jinggong-runtime.mjs to the pinned
openai/codex rust-v0.156.1 source tree. It changes the Cargo package and
binary identity, the CLI help/completion identity, the provider user-agent
originator, and the HTTP client user-agent. The App Server stdio JSONL
protocol and the upstream execution implementation remain unchanged.

Files changed by the reproducible patch:

  codex-rs/cli/Cargo.toml
  codex-rs/Cargo.lock
  codex-rs/cli/src/main.rs
  codex-rs/login/src/auth/default_client.rs
  codex-rs/backend-client/src/client.rs

Expected identity after build:

  jinggong-runtime 0.1.0
  jinggong_runtime/0.1.0 (精工 Agent; 0.1.0)
